# Slingshot on UMAP space,

CM starting cluster, clusterAnn2

```{r}
v6.1_sce <-  slingshot(v6.1_sce, 
                                   clusterLabels = v6.1_sce$clusterAnn2, 
                                   reducedDim = "UMAP", 
                                   approx_points = FALSE,
                                   start.clus = "CM", 
                                   extend = 'n',
                                   stretch = 0)
